  "description": "벨이 보는 나띠는 OO라고!? 키오프 멤버들의 캐해 종결판! | 캐해연구소 | Idol Character Lab | KISS OF LIFE | 쥴리 나띠 벨 하늘\n\n#KISSOFLIFE#Idol_Character_Lab#AD#New1theKOriginal#1theK#원더케이#원더케이오리지널\n\nThe final edition of character interpretation of the KISS OF LIFE members! \nWhat kind of gift does BELLE want to give to JULIE? What’s the animal JULIE thinks similar to HANEUL?\nFrom their frank (?) expressions to each other \nto the comforting and supporting phrases in different styles!   \nTime to learn about the real characters of the idol members! \nCheck this episode of KISS OF LIFE of Idol Character Lab right now! \n\n[KISS OF LIFE 멤버들의 캐해로 만들어진 소중한 한정판 핸디 파우치 패키지]\n\n사랑스러운 쥴리의 곰아지🐶\n엉뚱발랄 나띠의 병아리🐣\n엘레강스한 벨의 가젤🦌\n최강막내 하늘의 팔베개 고양이😺\n\n깜찍한 키오프 멤버들의 굿즈는 [캐해연구소 EP.01 KISS OF LIFE] 마플샵에서 확인해주세요🥰\n💙 https://abit.ly/rq26x3\n* 예약 구매 기간: 2024. 10. 30 18:00 ~ 2024. 11. 30 23:59 (KST)\n* 배송 예정일정: 2025. 01 중순 순차 배송 시작\n* 패키지 구성\n    ✔️ Handy Pouch 1EA\n    ✔️ Acrylic Keyring 4EA\n    ✔️ Wapen Pin Badge 4EA\n    ✔️ Polaroid Photo 5EA\n\nK-POP Wonderland, 1theK\nK-POP의 모든 즐거움이 여기에,\n다양한 원더케이 오리지널 컨텐츠를 만나보세요!\n\nK-POP Wonderland, 1theK\nAll the joys of K-pop here!\n1theK has a wide variety of Original Content\n\n▶1theK YouTube https://www.youtube.com/1theK\n▶1theK Originals YouTube  https://www.youtube.com/1theKOriginals\n▶1theK Live YouTube https://www.youtube.com/@1theKLive\n▶1theK Facebook  http://www.facebook.com/1theK\n▶1theK Twitter https://twitter.com/1theK\n▶1theK TikTok  https://www.tiktok.com/@1thek\n▶1theK Live Instagram https://www.instagram.com/1thek_live/",
